[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0391","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0391.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0468","title":"惠普 HP-UX 10.20/11.0 man 符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于 HP-UX 10.20 和 11.0 操作系统中，其 `man` 命令在处理临时文件时存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可在 /tmp 等可写目录下创建恶意符号链接指向敏感系统文件，当 `man` 命令卸载帮助手册文件时会意外写入数据到攻击者控制的目标文件，导致任意文件被覆盖或破坏。攻击者无需认证即可利用此漏洞，仅需拥有本地访问权限及对 /tmp 目录的写入权限，即可实现对系统关键文件的篡改，威胁系统的完整性和可用性，机密性影响较小。该漏洞属于经典的 Unix 符号链接竞争条件漏洞，反映了早期 Unix 系统在临时文件处理上的安全设计缺陷，攻击者通过精心构造的符号链接实现权限提升或系统破坏。建议用户及时应用 HP 官方发布的安全补丁，并加强 /tmp 目录的权限控制，禁止普通用户创建硬链接和符号链接。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0468"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:47Z","remediation":"建议修补HP-UX系统安全漏洞，立即应用HP-UX安全更新补丁以修复man命令的缺陷；同时加强/tmp目录的安全控制，禁止普通用户在/tmp中创建硬链接和符号链接，并定期清理/tmp目录中的可疑链接文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1302","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.SOL.4.02.10006021014400.4779-100000%40nofud.nwest.attws.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19990","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0468.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0468","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0468.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0468.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4xc4-j2qx-w95p/GHSA-4xc4-j2qx-w95p.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0468.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--19a2e879-672d-4af8-bf07-664ff493d956.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0391.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1111","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0509","title":"Sambar Server 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Sambar Server 4.3 的 finger 和 whois 演示脚本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需进行身份认证，只需向目标服务器发送包含超长主机名的请求即可触发该漏洞。由于脚本未对输入长度进行有效边界检查，过长的 hostname 参数会覆盖内存中的返回地址，使攻击者得以执行任意系统命令并完全控制服务器。该漏洞影响 Sambar Server 4.3 版本，CVSS v2 评分为 10.0，危害等级极高。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0509"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:53Z","remediation":"Sambar Server 受影响版本为 4.3 beta 9，其中 finger 与 whois 演示脚本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，可导致远程攻击者执行任意命令。立即缓解措施：删除或禁用 scripts 目录下 finger.cgi 与 whois.cgi 演示脚本。根治方案：升级至 Sambar Server 4.4 beta 或更高版本（5.x/6.x），厂商已在后续版本中修复 sambar.dll 的边界检查缺陷。升级前请备份配置文件，升级后验证 finger 与 whois 功能已移除或不再存在溢出风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95990103207665&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1287","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/22fc02e0bffd4b75ea6ac00629aace3b9e1913af/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0509.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0509","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0509.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f1d287a627fd4d192291c618f3010c17d678803/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0509.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mxw3-4cwc-mr3p/GHSA-mxw3-4cwc-mr3p.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1287/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0509.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/d7b94cc8fb397ef58e7351c3d2c6e3d393a4243c/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1111.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0548","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0548.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0487","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 弱加密漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 的受保护存储（Protected Store）模块在选择加密算法时存在缺陷，未能正确选取可用的最强加密方式，导致默认使用 40 位加密而非 56 位 DES 加密。该漏洞允许本地攻击者通过访问受保护存储中的敏感数据，获取使用弱加密保护的信息，从而造成信息泄露。攻击条件为攻击者需具备本地访问权限，CVSS 评分为 3.6，危害等级较低。Microsoft Windows 2000 均已受影响。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0487"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:50Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全更新 MS00-032 补丁，该补丁会替换 PSBASE.DLL 模块以确保后续使用最强可用加密。补丁中包含 Keymigrt.exe 工具，需提取并运行该工具重新加密受保护存储区（Protected Store）中已有的所有敏感数据，建议系统管理员将 Keymigrt.exe 加入用户登录脚本以确保下次登录时自动执行。同时安装 Windows 2000 Service Pack 1 可获取此修复。由于 Windows 2000 已停止支持，建议升级至受支持的操作系统版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1295","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-032","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/70be1be31c6d99bbb8181b2558b08838d9ece0a2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0487.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0487","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/3176af43a10fe85712ec51e894c680f4a3fa6e09/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0487.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/452639da22f67df44d3cc396784e359207f12277/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0487.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9110d9711889832b3e37763e54557b5327dd88f3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m4m3-6vcg-7fh3/GHSA-m4m3-6vcg-7fh3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0487.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--359e4d32-98e9-4583-81a1-0147fde099f5.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0548.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0548.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0425","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0425.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0507","title":"Concatus IMate Web Mail Server 2.5 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Concatus IMate Web Mail Server 2.5 存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞。该邮件服务器在处理 SMTP 协议的 HELO 命令时，未能对输入参数长度进行有效边界检查，攻击者可通过发送超长 HELO 命令触发缓冲区溢出。此漏洞影响所有使用该版本软件部署的邮件服务器，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可利用。攻击者只需向目标服务器的 SMTP 端口发送特制的超长 HELO 数据包，即可导致服务崩溃或挂起，造成拒绝服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0507"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:53Z","remediation":"升级 Concatus IMate Web Mail Server 至最新可用版本，或迁移至仍在维护的邮件服务器（如 Postfix、Exchange）。在无法升级时，可在防火墙或反向代理层限制 SMTP HELO/EHLO 命令长度不超过 100 字符，阻断超长载荷请求以缓解缓冲区溢出攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95990195708509&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1286","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4586","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19976","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2000/CVE-2000-0507.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7018a2a234cd62e492f0cf2df63817c94e1709c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0507.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0507","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eb60785016ff08ce04799a85f3182a152778faef/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0507.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0507.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g889-x6p3-66f6/GHSA-g889-x6p3-66f6.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/I/imate_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0507.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0425.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0416","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0416.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0493","title":"Atrus Trivalie Productions Simple Network Time Sync 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0493是Simple Network Time Sync (SMTS)守护程序的一个严重缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞影响于Atrus Trivalie Productions推出的Simple Network Time Sync 1.0版本。攻击者可以通过向目标系统发送超长的字符串到SMTS守护程序来触发缓冲区溢出。攻击者无需身份验证即可远程发起攻击，漏洞利用可能导致服务瘫痪和任意代码执行。CVSS评分达到10.0（最高等级），表明攻击者完全控制目标系统的可能性极大，导致系统不可用、数据泄露和完整性破坏的风险极高。该漏洞源于对网络时间同步协议处理数据时的内存管理缺陷，攻击者可以精心构造的 payloads来溢出缓冲区，在堆栈或堆中执行恶意代码。这种类型的漏洞通常导致系统崩溃、权限提升或数据被窃取。漏洞影响范围广泛，因为SMTS服务运行在多种操作系统上，这意味着许多网络时间同步服务可能受到威胁。微软和Atrus Trivalie Productions已发布安全补丁。攻击者可能通过在网络时间同步协议交互中发送恶意数据包来利用此漏洞，或通过精心设计的网络包来触发溢出。此外，攻击者可能从网络上找到ExploitDB上的现成PoC（Exploits/19978）来协助漏洞利用。防范措施包括升级到最新版本、应用安全补丁、限制网络时间同步服务权限，以及进行网络流量监控以检测异常的长数据包传输。安全建议定期进行安全审计和漏洞扫描，以发现此类缓冲区溢出类型的漏洞。Microsoft和Atrus Trivalie Productions已在2000年6月1日发布了安全公告。安全关键性评估为C级，建议用户立即更新到最新版本以获取补丁。攻击者可能利用CVE-2000-0493来破坏时间同步服务，导致系统运行异常，甚至可能在系统上执行恶意代码，破坏系统完整性。为了保护系统安全，用户需要安装最新的安全更新，并监控网络时间同步服务的日志以检测异常操作。微软在2000年6月1日发布了关于CVE-2000-0493的安全公告，建议用户安装安全更新来修复此漏洞。微软在2000年6月1日发布了CVE-2000-0493的安全公告，警告用户此漏洞可能导致服务不可用和远程代码执行，因此用户应及时安装安全补丁以修复此漏洞。漏洞利用后，攻击者可以窃取系统权限，执行任意命令，或破坏系统完整性。系统管理员应确保网络时间同步服务系统的最新安全补丁，并进行定期的漏洞扫描，以确保系统安全。攻击者可能利用这个漏洞来破坏时间同步服务，导致系统运行异常，或窃取敏感数据。安全专家建议用户对网络时间同步服务进行连续监控，特别是当从未授权的IP地址收到超长数据包时，应立即进行安全审查。安全评估表明此漏洞可能导致严重的安全问题，因此建议用户尽快安装补丁以确保系统安全。系统管理员应定期检查系统日志，以检测任何异常的网络时间同步服务活动，以确保系统安全。用户应确保他们的网络时间同步服务已安装最新的安全更新，并对网络时间同步服务进行定期的安全检查，以确保系统的安全性和稳定性。微软和Atrus Trivalie Productions在2000年6月1日发布了关于此漏洞的安全公告，建议用户安装最新的安全补丁以修复此漏洞。警告用户注意：攻击者可能利用CVE-2000-0493来窃取系统隐私数据，破坏系统完整性，并未经授权地获得对系统的控制权，用户应立即采取安全措施以保护系统安全。用户应立即安装最新的安全更新，并对网络时间同步服务进行持续监控，以确保系统安全和稳定运行。系统管理员应随时准备对网络时间同步服务进行安全检查，以确保系统的完整性和数据安全。用户应确保他们的网络时间同步服务已安装最新的安全更新，并对网络时间同步服务进行持续监控，以确保系统的安全性和稳定性。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0493"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:51Z","remediation":"建议立即停用 Atrus Trivalie Simple Network Time Sync 1.0 守护进程，改用现代 NTP 实现如 chrony、NTPsec 或 systemd-timesyncd。若必须保留旧软件，请在防火墙层面禁止外部访问 UDP/TCP 123 端口，并限制仅允许受信任时间源访问守护进程端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vuln-dev/2000-q2/0843.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1289","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4602","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19978","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2a4c15d247e2aa1e32bb9712f81631be3a25fb82/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0493.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0493","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0493.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad51007022161bcf4c63e713af3138cc91fa14f3/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0493.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q486-58cq-c7gq/GHSA-q486-58cq-c7gq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0493.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0416.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0412","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0412.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0490","title":"NetWin DMail DSMTP 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"NetWin DMail 邮件服务器中的 DSMTP 组件 2.7q 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 SMTP 服务发送超长的 ETRN 请求，触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而在服务器进程中执行任意指令。攻击无需任何认证或用户交互，成功率较高，可完全控制受影响服务器。该漏洞影响 NetWin DMail 2.7 及 2.8 版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0490"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:50Z","remediation":"立即升级至 NetWin DMail 2.7r（正式版）或 2.8k（测试版），下载地址 https://netwinsite.com/dmail/download.htm。升级前可使用 `grep \"etrn\" /usr/local/dmail/dwatch/*.ded` 检查是否已被利用；若发现最近 3 天内存在匹配记录，说明系统可能已遭入侵，建议同时进行全系统安全审计。如无法立即升级，可在网络层面限制对 SMTP 端口的非信任来源访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0407.html","http://netwinsite.com/dmail/security.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1297","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4579","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19983","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3290bfd28d98351fcc1665e3427425a500ba46e2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0490.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0490","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0490.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d927d63ee32587ef80d9e763226701b1dc32c67d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0490.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/64db5db4a6681c330f93cc62718610a5bc70bd7a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h876-2gr4-3rq5/GHSA-h876-2gr4-3rq5.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0490.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/dmail_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0490.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0412.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0399","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0399.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0476","title":"XFree86 X11R6 转义序列拒绝服务漏洞","description":"XFree86 X11R6 3.3.3/4.0 及衍生终端模拟器（xterm、Eterm、rxvt、PuTTY 0.48 等）存在转义序列处理缺陷，远程攻击者可向受害者终端发送特制的窗口大小调整转义序列，强制终端窗口反复调整大小导致资源耗尽，最终导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行受影响 X11R6 版本的 Linux/Unix 系统，CVSS 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），攻击者只需向受害终端发送特制转义字符即可触发，无需认证即可远程导致终端程序崩溃或系统资源耗尽。ExploitDB 已有公开 PoC（Eterm 0.8.10 / rxvt 2.6.1 / PuTTY 0.48 / X11R6 3.3.3/4.0），GNOME VTE 后续也出现类似变体 CVE-2024-37535。厂商未提供官方补丁，建议升级至修复版本的终端模拟器或禁用不受信的终端输入。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0476"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:48Z","remediation":"建议升级 XFree86 至 4.0.1 及以上版本，或升级 xterm 至 3.1.6G 以上、rxvt 至 2.7.10 以上、Eterm 至 0.9.0 以上版本。缓解措施：在终端配置中禁用窗口大小调整转义序列（如 xterm 的 allowWindowOps 资源设为 false），或在防火墙层面限制非受信终端连接访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0409.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0420.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2024/06/09/1","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2024/06/09/2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1298","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19984","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dd627d6b90f81690ae15e5d5fb02176cc79caf3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0476.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0476","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0476.md","https://github.com/krafthack-by-techday/Night-s-watch/blob