遍历漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 1.3.x Windows 版本存在目录遍历漏洞，源于对包含大量 \"/\" 字符的 URL 请求处理不当。远程未认证攻击者可发送包含大量斜杠（如 /////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////）的 HTTP GET 请求，绕过路径规范化检查，导致服务器返回 Web 根目录甚至系统根目录的文件列表，泄露敏感文件结构信息。影响版本包括 Apache 1.3.6、1.3.9、1.3.11、1.3.12、1.3.20 Windows 版本。攻击条件为：目标运行受影响版本的 Apache on Windows，攻击者可发送 HTTP 请求。CVSS 5.0（中危），攻击向量网络、低复杂度、无需认证、部分机密性影响。Apache 已在后续版本修复该路径规范化缺陷，建议升级至修复版本或迁移至非 Windows 平台。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0505"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:52Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 1.3.21 或更高版本（或升级至 2.x 分支），该版本修复了 Windows 平台上多重斜杠导致的根目录遍历漏洞。若暂无法升级，请在 httpd.conf 中为所有目录配置 `Options -Indexes` 禁用目录列表，并在 `<Directory />` 中设置 `Require all denied` 限制根目录访问，同时在防火墙层面拦截包含过多连续斜杠的异常请求作为临时缓解措施。升级包可从 Apache 官网 httpd.apache.org/download.cgi 获取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1284","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.BSF.4.20.0006031912360.45740-100000%40alive.znep.com","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4575","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5419c9ba0951ef73a655362403d12bb8d10fab38274deb3f005816f5%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5f9c22f9c28adbd9f00556059edc7b03a5d5bb71d4bb80257c0d34e4%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9f93cf6dde308d42a9c807784e8102600d0397f5f834890708bf6920%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rb9c9f42dafa25d2f669dac2a536a03f2575bc5ec1be6f480618aee10%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf2f0f3611f937cf6cfb3b4fe4a67f69885855126110e1e3f2fb2728e%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf6449464fd8b7437704c55f88361b66f12d5b5f90bcce66af4be4ba9%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19975","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2000/CVE-2000-0505.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0505.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0505","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/httpd-vulnerabilities/blob/b71e143e670cd0a24ad5402f3d46c0ba20429842/cves/CVE-2000-0505.yml","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0505.yaml%231","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f7e3d84312983fcf49d3199fbaaf2fad83c05d2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0505.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0505.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hcmr-mv5h-wj39/GHSA-hcmr-mv5h-wj39.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/apache_slash.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0422.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0422.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1109","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0488","title":"ITHouse Mail Server 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>ITHouse Mail Server 1.04 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过发送超长的 RCPT TO 邮件命令触发该漏洞，进而在服务器上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响运行 ITHouse Mail Server 1.04 的 Windows 系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可从网络端发起利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0488"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:50Z","remediation":"立即将 ITHouse Mail Server 升级至官方发布的无缓冲区溢出版本（版本号需 ≥ 修复版本），若厂商已停止维护该版本，则在邮件服务器前端部署 SMTP 过滤器（如 smtp-nel-filter）以拦截超长 RCPT TO 命令，同时在防火墙层面限制外部对邮件服务端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q2/0148.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1285","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4580","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2000/CVE-2000-0488.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d056d8ae56f5d770f04fc59fa77c6fef447db4a1/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0488.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0488","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d927d63ee32587ef80d9e763226701b1dc32c67d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0488.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0488.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/64db5db4a6681c330f93cc62718610a5bc70bd7a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wwh9-4j47-4fcq/GHSA-wwh9-4j47-4fcq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0488.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/a593987addca94d33e8613239bbbb761eaab2477/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1109.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1109.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0545","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0545.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0486","title":"Cisco TACACS+ tac_plus 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco TACACS+（tac_plus）服务器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送携带超长长度字段的畸形数据包触发该漏洞，导致目标设备拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行TACACS+服务的Cisco IOS设备，攻击条件为无需认证即可从网络远程发起请求，利用方式简单直接。CVSS评分为5.0，危害等级为中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0486"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:50Z","remediation":"Cisco 已发布针对 tac_plus 服务器缓冲区溢出漏洞的安全补丁，建议立即升级 tac_plus 至修复该漏洞的版本，或升级受影响 Cisco IOS 版本至包含补丁的发布版本。同时应在网络边界通过访问控制列表限制仅可信管理网段可访问 TACACS+ TCP 49 端口，如临时无法打补丁，可在边界防火墙上阻断外部对该端口的访问作为缓解措施。若网络中未使用 TACACS+ 认证服务，建议在路由器与交换机上禁用相关认证配置以消除风险暴露面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0369.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0370.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1293","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4985","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/af9951ed676bcfbcd0689aad53e974095f78dc27/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0486.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0486","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c6db79ec54738aa67e7f26ae3b03fbb6f3301176/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0486.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8ac1704ec258f0ded20dc2e1c602afda5159d6d8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0486.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/adc271babd480768bde3df62a81974dbf85b7783/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g5m7-gw4j-cjhj/GHSA-g5m7-gw4j-cjhj.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0486.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0486.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--608d6b4b-25cc-420a-a06c-98b9a9a3590d.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0545.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0544","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0544.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0485","title":"Microsoft SQL Server DTS 密码泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 的数据转换服务（DTS）包属性对话框存在密码明文存储缺陷，本地用户可通过查看该对话框直接读取数据库连接密码，从而获取对数据库的未授权访问权限。该漏洞利用条件低，攻击者只需具备目标系统的本地访问权限即可触发，无需网络攻击或特殊身份认证。影响范围涵盖使用 DTS 包存储数据库连接信息的所有 SQL Server 版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0485"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:50Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-041 修补程序（KB Q264880），该补丁会消除 DTS 包属性对话框和 Enterprise Manager 中密码以明文方式暴露的漏洞。若暂时无法安装补丁，可采取以下缓解措施：禁用 MSDB 数据库的 Guest 访问权限，限制 DTS 包的编辑权限仅授予所有者，使用 Windows 身份验证代替 SQL Server 身份验证来运行 DTS 包，并定期检查已注册的服务器配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/62771","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1292","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-041","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4582","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/98f5df8bf40c6af0934fb1e8baa83eb4ebb7d422/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0485.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0485","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c6db79ec54738aa67e7f26ae3b03fbb6f3301176/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0485.md","https:/